<title>UK: Alpha Airports H1 pretax profit drops.</title>
<headline>Alpha Airports H1 pretax profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.85		   vs 5.20</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.75		   vs 1.75</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    10.0		   vs 11.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   323.2		  vs 248.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Alpha Airports Group Plc, the flight services and retail trading group, said its profits were affected by market pressure on its catering business.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 12.8		   vs 11.6</p>
<p> Interest payable	 3.0		    vs 0.6</p>
<p> Tax paid		   3.3		    vs 3.2</p>
<p> Net taxed		  6.7		    vs 8.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
